<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/6/eng@/~cl_13> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 50c of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsections: “(1a) The Commission may, from time to time, issue any guidelines in writing on any matter relating to the importation of electricity and exportation of electricity. (1b) The Commission may, from time to time, issue any guidelines in writing on any matter relating to green attributes including— (a) the determination of ownership of green attributes; (b) the verification of the amount of green attributes; and (c) the certification of green attributes from the electricity generated or supplied from any renewable energy sources.”. Amendment of section 50e"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/6/eng@> .
