<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/6/eng@/~cl_16> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who, either alone or jointly or in common with another person, carries out the importation of electricity or exportation of electricity activity immediately before the commencement of this Act shall apply for the importation of electricity or exportation of electricity licence under the principal Act within six months from the date of coming into operation of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/6/eng@> .
