<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/6/eng@/~cl_9> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 32 the following part: “PART VIA GREEN ATTRIBUTES Green attributes 32a. The Minister may, upon the recommendation of the Commission, determine the standards, specifications, practices and measures to be adopted and any other matters in relation to green attributes.”. Amendment of section 37"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/6/eng@> .
